X: 1
T: From All Thy Saints in Warfare
T: (also known as By All Your Saints in Warfare)
C: Words: Horatio Nelson, 1864. 
C: Music: 'Kings Lynn' Traditional English.  Setting: "The English Hymnal", 1906.
C: copyright: public domain.  This score is a part of the Open Hymnal Project, 2025 Revision.
S: Music source: "The English Hymnal", 1906 Hymn 562
S: Lyrics Source: "A Hymnal" (Episcopal), 1916 Hymn 267
